<title>UK: Russia Tatneft GAAP accounts for 1994/95.</title>
<headline>Russia Tatneft GAAP accounts for 1994/95.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are U.S. GAAP accounts prepared by accountants Price Waterhouse for Russian oil company Tatneft, which is to undertake a level three American Depositary Receipt issue to foreign investors</p>
<p>						1994	   1995	 1995</p>
<p>					    Roubles bln Roubles bln   $million</p>
<p>    Sales and operating revenues  9,933,282   13,166,435   2,577</p>
<p>    Other income			  176,688	218,441	43</p>
<p>    Earnings from equity investment   9,574	 77,669	15</p>
<p>    TOTAL REVENUES		   10,119,544   13,462,545   2,635</p>
<p>COST AND OTHER DEDUCTIONS</p>
<p>    Operating expenses		3,613,538   3,650,775	715</p>
<p>Exploration expenses, incl</p>
<p>    dry holes			     247,611	559,199     109</p>
<p>    Selling, general,admin expenses 772,198    1,103,937     216</p>
<p>Depreciation,depletion,</p>
<p>    amortisation			1,405,134     1,510,179    296</p>
<p>    Taxes other than income	 1,939,476     4,270,708    836</p>
<p>Maintenance of social</p>
<p>    infrastructure			 186,403	 209,325    41</p>
<p>    Total costs &amp; other deduction 8,164,360    11,304,123  2,213</p>
<p>INCOME BEFORE MONETARY EFFECTS</p>
<p>    AND DEDUCTIONS		    1,955,184     2,158,422    422</p>
