<p>    Interest expense		    145,383	 165,179     32</p>
<p>    Total monetary effects	    146,811	 857,439    167</p>
<p>    INCOME BEFORE INCOME TAXES    2,101,995     1,300,983    255</p>
<p>Income taxes</p>
<p>    Current				 224,045	 983,345    193</p>
<p>    Deferred				369,511	 189,062     37</p>
